{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202653GYTa10Gl1792736741.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>強颱風薔琵迫近台灣，全島縣市停工停課，至少造成1死94人受傷。本港往返台北、高雄等地全日超過70班航班取消。</p><p></p><p>受薔琵的外圍環流影響，基隆沿海地區早上有強風和驟雨，不時有大浪拍打岸邊，海灘封閉，禁止遊人進入。台灣東部的花蓮亦刮起強風，有樹木被吹斷，亦有屋頂的廣告牌倒塌。另外，雲林縣有電線杆損壞，近3千戶停電，當局派員搶修。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER 1300._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OwjMfI3sfQ1792732496.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>在屏東縣，一個男人周四中午到海灘觀浪時被大浪捲走，搜救人員尋獲時已經沒有生命跡象。當局呼籲民眾，留在室內以及遠離岸邊。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER 1300._003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KJYTIDgEil1792732494.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>氣象部門指，薔琵的中心附近風力達14級，預料會繼續向西北方向移動，靠近台灣東北部，強度亦會緩慢減弱。明日上午會採取偏北路徑，之後轉往東北方向，趨向日本西南部沿海。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER 1300._004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ehLLcH3UOq1792732492.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>受風暴影響，國泰航空、香港航空、中華航空及長榮航空，今日全日有至少72班往返香港至台北、高雄、台中等地的航班取消。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:59.025202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:09.839460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:15.199111+00:00","content_hash":"59f762d46c72dbe2422c5ab7af6c3d18fc427b87ff9e7740cc56e95e7f6574e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:59.025202+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}